ention system capability and required\ncapability to create custom ips signature and policy\n20. capable to identify and block command and control required\ncommunication.\n21. able to block malicious domain or web category and required\nenforce restriction on unwanted domain or url\n22. able to create custom web category and enforce web required\nfilterpolicy with custom category.\n23. web keyword monitoring and enforcement to log, required\nreport or block web content matching keyword lists\nwith the option to upload\ncustoms lists\n24. appliance should have feature support for both ha required\nfunctionalities i.e. active -active and active - passive\nfor redundancy in future if and when required.\n25. firewall should have the feasibility to choose/dedicate required\na port as ha link. also, high availability should\nsupport creation of multiple ha link pairs to add\nresiliency in case one ha link fails, so that ha can\nfacilitated robustly.\n27. port agnostic dpi scanning required\n28. capable to inspect tls1.1, tls1.2 and tls required\n1.3 inspection\n29. should beable toenforce policy on certificate state required\n(like invalid date, untrusted issuer, name mismatch\netc ..), protocol and cipher for deep packet inspection\n30. should be able to apply application filtering and required\ncontrol\n31. advanced threat protection (detect and block required\nnetwork traffic attempting to contact command and\ncontrol servers using multi-\nlayered dns, afc, and firewall)\n32. able to authenticate users with local database and required\nalso capability to integrate active directory, ldap\nserver, radius server, tacacs server and\nedirectory\n33. built in capability for multi factor authentication required\nfor users without any additional cost\n34. must have sd-wan capability and have feature to required\ncreate sla profile with jitter,latency,packet loss.\nand same should be demonstrated by oem/vender in\npost bid poc if requested.\n35. sdwan feature must have source,